# This project relies on external tools (Go binaries), not Python packages.
# There are currently no external Python dependencies required — the script
# only uses Python's standard library (argparse, subprocess, pathlib, re, shutil).
#
# Required external tools (installed separately, see README.md):
#   - subfinder
#   - assetfinder
#   - amass
#   - dnsx
#   - httpx
#   - katana
#   - waybackurls
